A directory for Continuous Integration tooling.

Dependency updates are proposed by Renovate (Mend GitHub App), configured in
.github/renovate.json. Major updates wait for approval on the Dependency
Dashboard issue. Version caps keep Mockito < 5, JUnit < 6 and junit-pioneer < 2
(Java 8 target), and Checkstyle < 11 and maven-bundle-plugin < 6 (CI runs on
JDK 11): lift them only when the Java baseline moves.
